 },
 "html": "<h2 id=\"secao-14-1\">14.1 Como extrair insights</h2>\n<p>Um insight é um <strong>padrão relevante para a decisão</strong>, com evidência e com uma explicação plausível. Para cada resultado, pergunte:</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>O quê?</strong> Qual é o padrão, com números (n, %, média, diferença)?</li>\n<li><strong>É real?</strong> Ele se sustenta com o teste estatístico, o tamanho de efeito, o n suficiente e sem depender de outliers?</li>\n<li><strong>Por quê?</strong> Qual é a explicação mais plausível? Há explicações alternativas (terceira variável, viés de coleta)?</li>\n<li><strong>E daí?</strong> Que decisão ou ação ele sugere?</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>Padrões que costumam gerar insights</strong></p>\n<div aria-label=\"Padrões que costumam gerar insights\" class=\"tabela\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Sinal nos dados</th>\n<th>Possível interpretação</th>\n<th>Onde aparece</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Picos em valores redondos (5, 10, 15...)</td>\n<td>dados declarados e arredondados por quem respondeu</td>\n<td>histograma (<a href=\"/explorar/analise-univariada/#secao-6-1\">6.1</a>)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Média bem maior que a mediana</td>\n<td>poucos valores altos dominam: reportar a mediana</td>\n<td><code>describe</code> (<a href=\"/explorar/estatistica-descritiva/#secao-5-1\">5.1</a>)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Duas \"nuvens\" na dispersão</td>\n<td>duas populações misturadas: segmentar</td>\n<td>dispersão (<a href=\"/explorar/analise-bivariada-e-multivariada/#secao-8-5\">8.5</a>)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Correlação geral some dentro dos grupos</td>\n<td>a relação é explicada pelo grupo, não pela variável</td>\n<td>correlação por grupo (<a href=\"/explorar/analise-bivariada-e-multivariada/#secao-8-5\">8.5</a>)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Diferença entre grupos ligada à \"idade\" do registro</td>\n<td>efeito de geração/coorte (quem entrou antes tem perfil diferente)</td>\n<td><code>groupby</code> + violino (<a href=\"/explorar/analise-bivariada-e-multivariada/#secao-8-3\">8.3</a>)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Muitos nulos em um perfil específico</td>\n<td>ausência não aleatória: conclusões enviesadas</td>\n<td>nulos (<a href=\"/preparar/primeira-inspecao/#secao-3-3\">3.3</a>)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Poucos casos extremos com grande peso no total</td>\n<td>concentração (regra 80/20): priorizar esses casos</td>\n<td>outliers (<a href=\"/explorar/outliers/#secao-7-3\">7.3</a>), ranking (<a href=\"/explorar/analise-bivariada-e-multivariada/#secao-8-3\">8.3</a>)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Diferença significativa, mas efeito pequeno</td>\n<td>estatisticamente real, mas pouco relevante na prática</td>\n<td>tamanho de efeito (<a href=\"/inferir/efeito-e-automacao/#secao-12-9\">12.9</a>)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div>\n<h2 id=\"secao-14-2\">14.2 Como reportar resultados estatísticos</h2>\n<p>Use sempre o mesmo padrão, com <strong>estatística, graus de liberdade, p-valor, tamanho de efeito e n</strong>:</p>\n<div aria-label=\"estatística, graus de liberdade, p-valor, tamanho de efeito e n\" class=\"tabela\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Resultado</th>\n<th>Modelo de frase</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Descritiva</td>\n<td>\"O grupo A apresentou média de <strong>X ± DP</strong> (mediana <strong>Y</strong>; n = <strong>N</strong>).\"</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Teste t</td>\n<td>\"O grupo A apresentou média superior ao grupo B (<strong>t</strong>(gl) = valor; <strong>p</strong> &lt; 0,001; <strong>d</strong> = valor; IC 95% da diferença: [li; ls]).\"</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ANOVA</td>\n<td>\"Houve diferença entre os grupos (<strong>F</strong>(gl₁, gl₂) = valor; <strong>p</strong> &lt; 0,001; <strong>η²</strong> = valor). O pós-teste de Games-Howell indicou que...\"</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Não paramétrico</td>\n<td>\"As distribuições diferiram (Mann-Whitney <strong>U</strong> = valor; <strong>p</strong> = valor; <strong>r</strong> = valor). Medianas: A = ..., B = ...\"</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Correlação</td>\n<td>\"Houve correlação positiva moderada entre X e Y (Spearman <strong>ρ</strong> = valor; <strong>p</strong> &lt; 0,001; n = N).\"</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pressupostos</td>\n<td>\"Normalidade avaliada por Shapiro-Wilk e homogeneidade por Levene (α = 0,05). Por violação da homocedasticidade, usou-se o teste t com correção de Welch.\"</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div>\n<div class=\"codigo\" data-lang=\"python\"><div class=\"codigo__barra\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><span class=\"codigo__lang\">python</span><button class=\"codigo__copiar\" data-copiar=\"\" type=\"button\">Copiar</button></div><pre aria-label=\"Código python\" class=\"codigo__pre\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"1\"><span class=\"tk-kw\">def</span> <span class=\"tk-fn\">formatar_p</span>(p):</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"2\">    <span class=\"tk-com\"># Formata o p-valor no padrão de relatório.</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"3\">    <span class=\"tk-kw\">return</span> <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">p &lt; 0,001</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span> <span class=\"tk-kw\">if</span> p &lt; <span class=\"tk-num\">0.001</span> <span class=\"tk-kw\">else</span> <span class=\"tk-kw\">f</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">p = </span><span class=\"tk-str\">{</span>p<span class=\"tk-str\">:</span><span class=\"tk-str\">.3f</span><span class=\"tk-str\">}</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>.<span class=\"tk-fn\">replace</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">.</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">,</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"4\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"5\">res = <span class=\"tk-fn\">comparar_grupos</span>(df, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_num_2</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_binaria</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"6\"><span class=\"tk-bi\">print</span>(<span class=\"tk-kw\">f</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">{</span>res[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">teste</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>]<span class=\"tk-str\">}</span><span class=\"tk-str\">: estatística = </span><span class=\"tk-str\">{</span>res[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">estatística</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>]<span class=\"tk-str\">}</span><span class=\"tk-str\">; </span><span class=\"tk-str\">{</span><span class=\"tk-fn\">formatar_p</span>(res[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">p-valor</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>])<span class=\"tk-str\">}</span><span class=\"tk-str\">; </span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"7\">      <span class=\"tk-kw\">f</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">{</span>res[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">medida de efeito</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>]<span class=\"tk-str\">}</span><span class=\"tk-str\"> = </span><span class=\"tk-str\">{</span>res[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">efeito</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>]<span class=\"tk-str\">}</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>)</span></code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"saida\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><p class=\"saida__rotulo\">Saída</p><pre class=\"saida__texto\" tabindex=\"0\">Mann-Whitney: estatística = 43168.0; p &lt; 0,001; r rank-biserial = 0.441</pre></div>\n<h2 id=\"secao-14-3\">14.3 Gráfico final com significância anotada</h2>\n<p><strong>O que faz:</strong> mostra as médias dos grupos com barras de erro, os valores nas barras e a <strong>marcação de significância</strong> entre os pares comparados.</p>\n<p><strong>Quando usar:</strong> no relatório, para comunicar o resultado de um teste de forma visual.</p>\n<div class=\"codigo\" data-lang=\"python\"><div class=\"codigo__barra\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><span class=\"codigo__lang\">python</span><button class=\"codigo__copiar\" data-copiar=\"\" type=\"button\">Copiar</button></div><pre aria-label=\"Código python\" class=\"codigo__pre\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"1\"><span class=\"tk-kw\">def</span> <span class=\"tk-fn\">anotar_significancia</span>(ax, x1, x2, y, p, altura=<span class=\"tk-num\">0.02</span>):</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"2\">    <span class=\"tk-com\"># Desenha um colchete entre as posições x1 e x2 com o p-valor (ou asteriscos).</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"3\">    estrelas = <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">***</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span> <span class=\"tk-kw\">if</span> p &lt; <span class=\"tk-num\">0.001</span> <span class=\"tk-kw\">else</span> <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">**</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span> <span class=\"tk-kw\">if</span> p &lt; <span class=\"tk-num\">0.01</span> <span class=\"tk-kw\">else</span> <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">*</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span> <span class=\"tk-kw\">if</span> p &lt; <span class=\"tk-num\">0.05</span> <span class=\"tk-kw\">else</span> <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">ns</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"4\">    h = altura * (ax.<span class=\"tk-fn\">get_ylim</span>()[<span class=\"tk-num\">1</span>] - ax.<span class=\"tk-fn\">get_ylim</span>()[<span class=\"tk-num\">0</span>])</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"5\">    ax.<span class=\"tk-fn\">plot</span>([x1, x1, x2, x2], [y, y + h, y + h, y], color=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">black</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, linewidth=<span class=\"tk-num\">1.2</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"6\">    ax.<span class=\"tk-fn\">text</span>((x1 + x2) / <span class=\"tk-num\">2</span>, y + h, <span class=\"tk-kw\">f</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">{</span>estrelas<span class=\"tk-str\">}</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\\n</span><span class=\"tk-str\">{</span><span class=\"tk-fn\">formatar_p</span>(p)<span class=\"tk-str\">}</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, ha=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">center</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, va=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">bottom</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, fontsize=<span class=\"tk-num\">10</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"7\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"8\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"9\">ordem = [<span class=\"tk-num\">0</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">1</span>]</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"10\">fig, ax = plt.<span class=\"tk-fn\">subplots</span>(figsize=(<span class=\"tk-num\">6</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">5</span>))</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"11\">sns.<span class=\"tk-fn\">barplot</span>(data=df, x=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_binaria</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, y=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_num_2</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, hue=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_binaria</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, order=ordem,</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"12\">            errorbar=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">sd</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, capsize=<span class=\"tk-num\">0.1</span>, palette=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">viridis</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, width=<span class=\"tk-num\">0.5</span>, edgecolor=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">black</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, legend=<span class=\"tk-kw\">False</span>, ax=ax)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"13\"><span class=\"tk-kw\">for</span> container <span class=\"tk-kw\">in</span> ax.containers:</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"14\">    ax.<span class=\"tk-fn\">bar_label</span>(container, fmt=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">%.1f</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, label_type=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">center</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, color=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">white</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, fontsize=<span class=\"tk-num\">13</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"15\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"16\">_, p_par = stats.<span class=\"tk-fn\">ttest_ind</span>(grupo_1, grupo_2, equal_var=<span class=\"tk-kw\">False</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"17\">y_max = df.<span class=\"tk-fn\">groupby</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_binaria</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_num_2</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>].<span class=\"tk-fn\">agg</span>(<span class=\"tk-kw\">lambda</span> s: s.<span class=\"tk-fn\">mean</span>() + s.<span class=\"tk-fn\">std</span>()).<span class=\"tk-fn\">max</span>()</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"18\">ax.<span class=\"tk-fn\">set_ylim</span>(<span class=\"tk-num\">0</span>, y_max * <span class=\"tk-num\">1.3</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"19\"><span class=\"tk-fn\">anotar_significancia</span>(ax, <span class=\"tk-num\">0</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">1</span>, y_max * <span class=\"tk-num\">1.05</span>, p_par)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"20\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"21\">ax.<span class=\"tk-fn\">set_xticks</span>([<span class=\"tk-num\">0</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">1</span>], [<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">Grupo 0</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">Grupo 1</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>])</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"22\">ax.<span class=\"tk-fn\">set_xlabel</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"23\">ax.<span class=\"tk-fn\">set_ylabel</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">Média de coluna_num_2 (± DP)</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"24\">plt.<span class=\"tk-fn\">tight_layout</span>()</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"25\">plt.<span class=\"tk-fn\">show</span>()</span></code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"saida\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><p class=\"saida__rotulo\">Saída</p><figure class=\"figura\"><button aria-label=\"Ampliar imagem: Gráfico de barras com a média de coluna_num_2 para o Grupo 0 e o Grupo 1, barras de erro de desvio padrão, valor da média no centro de cada barra e um colchete entre as barras com asteriscos e o p-valor do teste.\" class=\"figura__ampliar\" data-ampliar=\"\" type=\"button\"><img alt=\"Gráfico de barras com a média de coluna_num_2 para o Grupo 0 e o Grupo 1, barras de erro de desvio padrão, valor da média no centro de cada barra e um colchete entre as barras com asteriscos e o p-valor do teste.\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"726\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/notebook/celula-260.webp\" width=\"877\"/><span class=\"figura__icone\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icone\" fill=\"none\" focusable=\"false\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M9 21H3v-6\"></path><path d=\"m21 3-7 7\"></path><path d=\"m3 21 7-7\"></path></svg></span></button></figure></div>\n<aside class=\"callout callout--alternativa\"><p class=\"callout__titulo callout__titulo--so-icone\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icone\" fill=\"none\" focusable=\"false\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6 3v12\"></path><circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"6\" r=\"3\"></circle><circle cx=\"6\" cy=\"18\" r=\"3\"></circle><path d=\"M18 9a9 9 0 0 1-9 9\"></path></svg><span class=\"sr-only\">Alternativa</span></p><div class=\"callout__corpo\"><p><strong>Alternativa: biblioteca <code>statannotations</code></strong> (<code>pip install statannotations</code>). Ela anota pares automaticamente a partir de p-valores já calculados, por exemplo os de um pós-teste:</p><div class=\"codigo\" data-lang=\"python\"><div class=\"codigo__barra\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><span class=\"codigo__lang\">python</span><button class=\"codigo__copiar\" data-copiar=\"\" type=\"button\">Copiar</button></div><pre aria-label=\"Código python\" class=\"codigo__pre\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"1\"><span class=\"tk-kw\">from</span> statannotations.Annotator <span class=\"tk-kw\">import</span> Annotator</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"2\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"3\">pares = <span class=\"tk-bi\">list</span>(<span class=\"tk-bi\">zip</span>(pos_teste[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">A</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>], pos_teste[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">B</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>]))          <span class=\"tk-com\"># pares do pós-teste (ex.: pg.pairwise_gameshowell)</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"4\">annotator = <span class=\"tk-fn\">Annotator</span>(ax, pares, data=df, x=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_cat</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, y=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_num</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"5\">annotator.<span class=\"tk-fn\">configure</span>(test=<span class=\"tk-kw\">None</span>, text_format=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">simple</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, loc=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">inside</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"6\">annotator.<span class=\"tk-fn\">set_pvalues_and_annotate</span>(pos_teste[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">pval</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>].values)</span></code></pre></div></div></aside>\n<aside class=\"callout callout--atencao\"><p class=\"callout__titulo callout__titulo--so-icone\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icone\" fill=\"none\" focusable=\"false\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg><span class=\"sr-only\">Atenção</span></p><div class=\"callout__corpo\"><p>Verifique a compatibilidade da versão do <code>statannotations</code> com o seu <code>seaborn</code>.</p></div></aside>\n<h2 id=\"secao-14-4\">14.4 Estrutura do relatório</h2>\n<p>Comece pelo que o leitor precisa decidir e deixe o detalhe técnico para o final.</p>\n<div class=\"codigo\" data-lang=\"text\"><div class=\"codigo__barra\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><span class=\"codigo__lang\">texto</span><button class=\"codigo__copiar\" data-copiar=\"\" type=\"button\">Copiar</button></div><pre aria-label=\"Código texto\" class=\"codigo__pre\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"1\">[TÍTULO DA ANÁLISE]</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"2\">Responsável: [nome] | Data: [dd/mm/aaaa] | Fonte dos dados: [origem, período]</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"3\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"4\">1. RESUMO EXECUTIVO (máx. 1 página)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"5\">   - Contexto: o que foi analisado (n, período, objetivo)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"6\">   - O que encontramos: 2-3 achados principais, em linguagem de negócio</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"7\">   - Por que isso importa: impacto para a decisão</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"8\">   - Ações prioritárias: 2-3 recomendações</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"9\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"10\">2. PRINCIPAIS ACHADOS</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"11\">   [Título do achado em forma de conclusão (ex.: \"Grupo X apresenta desempenho inferior\")]</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"12\">   - Evidência numérica: médias, %, n por grupo, diferença e IC</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"13\">   - Gráfico de suporte (1 por achado)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"14\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"15\">3. IMPLICAÇÕES</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"16\">   - O que cada achado significa para o negócio (indicador de risco, alavanca, oportunidade)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"17\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"18\">4. AÇÕES SUGERIDAS</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"19\">   - Curto prazo: ações rápidas, com critério objetivo (ex.: \"monitorar casos com métrica &lt; limite\")</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"20\">   - Médio/longo prazo: mudanças estruturais, novos indicadores, integração a sistemas</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"21\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"22\">5. DETALHAMENTO TÉCNICO</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"23\">   5.1 Dados e tratamento: filtros, remoções (quantas linhas e por quê), transformações</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"24\">   5.2 Análises descritivas: métricas usadas (média ± DP, CV, assimetria, curtose)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"25\">   5.3 Análises inferenciais: pressupostos (Shapiro-Wilk, Levene), testes escolhidos e motivo,</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"26\">       α, estatísticas, p-valores, tamanhos de efeito, pós-testes</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"27\">   5.4 Limitações: viés de amostra, nulos, causalidade não comprovada</span></code></pre></div><aside class=\"callout callout--atencao\"><p class=\"callout__titulo\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icone\" fill=\"none\" focusable=\"false\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg><span>O que observar</span></p><div class=\"callout__corpo\"><ul>\n<li>Títulos de achados devem ser <strong>conclusões</strong>, não descrições (\"O grupo A converte 2x mais\", e não \"Conversão por grupo\").</li>\n<li>Uma ideia por gráfico, e um gráfico por achado.</li>\n<li>Diga explicitamente quando o resultado é <strong>associação</strong>, e não causa.</li>\n</ul></div></aside>\n<h2 id=\"secao-14-5\">14.5 Exportação e pipeline reprodutível</h2>\n<p><strong>O que faz:</strong> salva as tabelas e gráficos finais e reúne o tratamento em um bloco único que pode ser executado de novo com novos dados.</p>\n<p><strong>Quando usar:</strong> ao final da exploração, quando as decisões de limpeza e as métricas já estão definidas. Leve para um bloco único (ou um script <code>.py</code>) <strong>apenas</strong> o que entra no resultado final.</p>\n<div class=\"codigo\" data-lang=\"python\"><div class=\"codigo__barra\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><span class=\"codigo__lang\">python</span><button class=\"codigo__copiar\" data-copiar=\"\" type=\"button\">Copiar</button></div><pre aria-label=\"Código python\" class=\"codigo__pre\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"1\"><span class=\"tk-com\"># Tabela final: consolidada, filtrada e ordenada</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"2\">tabela_final = (df</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"3\">    .<span class=\"tk-fn\">groupby</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_cat</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"4\">    .<span class=\"tk-fn\">agg</span>(n=(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_id</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">count</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>), total=(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_valor</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">sum</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>),</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"5\">         media=(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_num_2</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">mean</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>), duracao_media_dias=(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">duracao_dias</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">mean</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>))</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"6\">    .<span class=\"tk-fn\">query</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">n &gt;= 30</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)                                   <span class=\"tk-com\"># só grupos com n mínimo</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"7\">    .<span class=\"tk-fn\">sort_values</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">total</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, ascending=<span class=\"tk-kw\">False</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"8\">    .<span class=\"tk-fn\">round</span>(<span class=\"tk-num\">2</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"9\">    .<span class=\"tk-fn\">reset_index</span>())</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"10\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"11\">PASTA_SAIDA.<span class=\"tk-fn\">mkdir</span>(exist_ok=<span class=\"tk-kw\">True</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"12\">tabela_final.<span class=\"tk-fn\">to_excel</span>(CAMINHO_SAIDA_TABELA, index=<span class=\"tk-kw\">False</span>)          <span class=\"tk-com\"># requer openpyxl</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"13\">tabela_final.<span class=\"tk-fn\">to_csv</span>(PASTA_SAIDA / <span class=\"tk-kw\">f</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">tabela_</span><span class=\"tk-str\">{</span>PERIODO<span class=\"tk-str\">}</span><span class=\"tk-str\">.csv</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, index=<span class=\"tk-kw\">False</span>, sep=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">;</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, decimal=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">,</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, encoding=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">utf-8-sig</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"14\">tabela_final</span></code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"saida\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><p class=\"saida__rotulo\">Saída</p><div aria-label=\"Saída em tabela\" class=\"tabela\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table class=\"tabela-dados\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"col\"></th>\n<th scope=\"col\">coluna_cat</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">total</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">media</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">duracao_media_dias</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">0</th>\n<td>A</td>\n<td class=\"num\">490</td>\n<td class=\"num\">1,189,077.33</td>\n<td class=\"num\">85.99</td>\n<td class=\"num\">7.07</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">1</th>\n<td>B</td>\n<td class=\"num\">291</td>\n<td class=\"num\">725,061.62</td>\n<td class=\"num\">100.12</td>\n<td class=\"num\">6.68</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">2</th>\n<td>C</td>\n<td class=\"num\">189</td>\n<td class=\"num\">484,774.07</td>\n<td class=\"num\">107.92</td>\n<td class=\"num\">7.21</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">3</th>\n<td>Não informado</td>\n<td class=\"num\">30</td>\n<td class=\"num\">64,369.15</td>\n<td class=\"num\">101.30</td>\n<td class=\"num\">6.67</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div></div>\n<p><strong>Modelo de pipeline em bloco único</strong> (parâmetros no topo → leitura → tratamento → consolidação → exportação):</p>\n<div class=\"codigo\" data-lang=\"python\"><div class=\"codigo__barra\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><span class=\"codigo__lang\">python</span><button class=\"codigo__copiar\" data-copiar=\"\" type=\"button\">Copiar</button></div><pre aria-label=\"Código python\" class=\"codigo__pre\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"1\"><span class=\"tk-com\"># ===== Parâmetros =====</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"2\">PERIODO = <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">aaaa</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"3\">CAMINHO_DADOS = <span class=\"tk-fn\">Path</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">dados</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>) / <span class=\"tk-kw\">f</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">{</span>PERIODO<span class=\"tk-str\">}</span><span class=\"tk-str\">_nome_do_arquivo.csv</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"4\">CAMINHO_SAIDA = <span class=\"tk-fn\">Path</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">output</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"5\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"6\"><span class=\"tk-com\"># ===== Leitura =====</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"7\">df = pd.<span class=\"tk-fn\">read_csv</span>(CAMINHO_DADOS, sep=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">;</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, encoding=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">cp1252</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, decimal=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">,</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, thousands=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">.</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"8\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"9\"><span class=\"tk-com\"># ===== Tratamento =====</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"10\">df[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_cat</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>] = df[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_cat</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>].<span class=\"tk-fn\">fillna</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">Não informado</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"11\">df[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_data</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>] = pd.<span class=\"tk-fn\">to_datetime</span>(df[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_data</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>], <span class=\"tk-bi\">format</span>=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">%d</span><span class=\"tk-str\">/</span><span class=\"tk-str\">%</span><span class=\"tk-str\">m/</span><span class=\"tk-str\">%</span><span class=\"tk-str\">Y</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"12\">df[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_total</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>] = df[[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_1</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_2</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_3</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>]].<span class=\"tk-fn\">sum</span>(axis=<span class=\"tk-num\">1</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"13\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"14\"><span class=\"tk-com\"># ===== Consolidação =====</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"15\">tabela = (df.<span class=\"tk-fn\">groupby</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_cat</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"16\">            .<span class=\"tk-fn\">agg</span>(n=(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_id</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">count</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>), total=(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_total</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">sum</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>))</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"17\">            .<span class=\"tk-fn\">sort_values</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">total</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, ascending=<span class=\"tk-kw\">False</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"18\">            .<span class=\"tk-fn\">reset_index</span>())</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"19\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"20\"><span class=\"tk-com\"># ===== Exportação =====</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"21\">tabela.<span class=\"tk-fn\">to_excel</span>(CAMINHO_SAIDA / <span class=\"tk-kw\">f</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">tabela_</span><span class=\"tk-str\">{</span>PERIODO<span class=\"tk-str\">}</span><span class=\"tk-str\">.xlsx</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, index=<span class=\"tk-kw\">False</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"22\"><span class=\"tk-com\"># + gráfico final com fig.savefig(CAMINHO_SAIDA / f'grafico_{PERIODO}.png', bbox_inches='tight')</span></span></code></pre></div>",
